body:
The `PermissionSet` objects in this example don't match the actual `PermissionSet` type from @objectstack/spec/permission/permission.zod.ts.

The actual schema has:
- `name`: string (snake_case)
- `label`: string (optional)
- `isProfile`: boolean
- `objects`: record of ObjectPermission
- `fields`: record of FieldPermission (optional)
- `systemPermissions`: array of strings (optional)

But this example uses:
- `objectPermissions`: array with `object`, `create`, `read`, `update`, `delete`, `viewAll`, `modifyAll`
- `fieldPermissions`: array with `object`, `field`, `read`, `update`

The structure is completely different. The actual schema uses records (key-value maps) instead of arrays, and has different field names (e.g., `allowCreate` instead of `create`, `readable`/`editable` instead of `read`/`update`).

This will cause TypeScript compilation errors.
```suggestion
    isProfile: false,

    // Object permissions (record of ObjectPermission)
    objects: {
      account: {
        allowCreate: true,
        allowRead: true,
        allowUpdate: true,
        allowDelete: false,
        viewAll: false,
        modifyAll: false,
      },
      contact: {
        allowCreate: true,
        allowRead: true,
        allowUpdate: true,
        allowDelete: false,
        viewAll: false,
        modifyAll: false,
      },
      opportunity: {
        allowCreate: true,
        allowRead: true,
        allowUpdate: true,
        allowDelete: false,
        viewAll: false,
        modifyAll: false,
      },
      lead: {
        allowCreate: true,
        allowRead: true,
        allowUpdate: true,
        allowDelete: true, // Can delete own leads
        viewAll: false,
        modifyAll: false,
      },
    },

    // Field-level permissions (Field-Level Security, record of FieldPermission)
    fields: {
      'account.annual_revenue': {
        object: 'account',
        field: 'annual_revenue',
        readable: true,
        editable: false, // Can see but not edit revenue
      },
      'opportunity.probability': {
        object: 'opportunity',
        field: 'probability',
        readable: true,
        editable: false, // Calculated field, read-only
      },
    },
  },

  {
    name: 'sales_manager_permissions',
    label: 'Sales Manager Permissions',
    isProfile: false,

    // Object permissions (record of ObjectPermission)
    objects: {
      account: {
        allowCreate: true,
        allowRead: true,
        allowUpdate: true,
        allowDelete: true,
        viewAll: true, // Can view all accounts
        modifyAll: true, // Can modify all accounts
      },
      opportunity: {
        allowCreate: true,
        allowRead: true,
        allowUpdate: true,
        allowDelete: true,
        viewAll: true,
        modifyAll: true,
      },
      forecast: {
        allowCreate: true,
        allowRead: true,
        allowUpdate: true,
        allowDelete: true,
        viewAll: true,
        modifyAll: true,
      },
    },

    // Field-level permissions (Field-Level Security, record of FieldPermission)
    fields: {
      'account.annual_revenue': {
        object: 'account',
        field: 'annual_revenue',
        readable: true,
        editable: true, // Managers can edit revenue
      },
      'opportunity.discount_percent': {
        object: 'opportunity',
        field: 'discount_percent',
        readable: true,
        editable: true, // Managers can approve discounts
      },
    },
```
